From 6178954faa23c1bd276a97dc03a4144dfe360d01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Taniya Das <taniya.das@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 17:08:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] clk: qcom: sa8775p: Add debug mux for clock controllers

Add debug mux support for the clock controllers to measure the clock
frequencies on the Qualcomm SA8775P platform.

Signed-off-by: Taniya Das <taniya.das@oss.qualcomm.com>
---
 drivers/clk/qcom/camcc-sa8775p.c   | 24 +++++++++++++++
 drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc0-sa8775p.c | 24 +++++++++++++++
 drivers/clk/qcom/dispcc1-sa8775p.c | 24 +++++++++++++++
 drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sa8775p.c     | 48 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/clk/qcom/gpucc-sa8775p.c   | 24 +++++++++++++++
 drivers/clk/qcom/videocc-sa8775p.c | 24 +++++++++++++++
 6 files changed, 168 insertions(+)

